# Single config file for the engine (engine/cmd/pocketknife/main.go loads it
# via loadDotEnv). Only fills vars not already set in the environment, so an
# explicit `FOO=bar ./bin/pocketknife` always wins over this file. Missing
# file is fine -- config can come from the environment directly
# (systemd/docker/CI).

# No engine-level config is required yet. Add vars here as the new agent and
# frontend (apps/web, apps/runtime) are rebuilt and need them.
